  "description": "Inspired by King of Gravel—the celebrated Italian gravel ride hosted by IRONTRUST—the VELOCI KOG is built around the simple idea of taking the long way home. Made for riders who pack a bag, pick a direction, and keep rolling, whether it’s a weekend escape or a trip without a fixed destination.\n\nIts MKPT Chromoly tubing—seamless, heat-treated, and multi-butted—delivers a smooth and confident ride feel, equally at home on rough gravel roads and quiet backroads. Our signature steel fin dropout adds strength and precision, while full SHIMANO Di2 compatibility keeps the setup clean and modern.\n\nPaired with the versatile No.11 carbon fork, the KOG offers plenty of mounting options for racks, cages, and bags, making it ready for everything from daily rides to longer adventures. Stealth dropper post routing and ED black coating inside and out add durability and practicality where it matters.\n\nWherever the road leads, the KOG is an easy-going yet capable steel bike built for wandering a little further.",
